Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 23:43:32 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] ptlc: the ptlc.* command family, built against znn_sdk_dart
 1.0.0

Create, unlock, proxyUnlock, reclaim, get, inspect and monitor as for htlc,
plus the key and adaptor helpers a swap needs around them (keygen, point,
tweak, tweakSecret, message, sign, adaptorSign/Verify/Complete/Extract).
The pubspec overrides znn_sdk_dart to the sibling ptlc worktree and drops
the bip39 package, whose pointycastle 3 pin conflicts with SDK 1.0.0; the
mnemonic check uses the SDK's own Mnemonic.validateMnemonic.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
